{
  "id": "DEU.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Dute 8",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lizakugcina kuhle yonke imithetho engililaya ngayo lamuhla, liyenze ukuze liphile, lande, lingene elizweni lilithumbe, iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu eyafunga ukulinika okhokho benu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likhumbule yonke indlela iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu elihole ngayo kuliminyaka engamatshumi amane enkangala, ukuba ilithobise, ilihlole, ibone imicabango yenhliziyo zenu ukuba ibone ukuthi lizakuyigcina imithetho yayo yini, loba ayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho yalithobisa, yalilambisa, yalinika ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " elalingayazi labokhokho benu babengalazi, ukuba ilifundise ukuthi umuntu kaphili ngesinkwa sodwa, kodwa uphila ngawo wonke amazwi aphuma emlonyeni weNkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.4.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 4:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.4.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 4:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuleyominyaka engamatshumi amane izambatho zenu kaziguganga, lenyawo zenu kazivuvukanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yazini enhliziyweni zenu ukuthi njengalokhu umuntu elaya indodana yakhe, ngokunjalo iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu iyalilaya lani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke lizagcina imithetho yeNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu, lihambe ngendlela zayo, liyesabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu isizakulingenisa elizweni elihle, ilizwe elilemifula yamanzi, lemithombo yamanzi agobhoza ezihotsheni lezintabeni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilizwe elilamabele ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", lezivini, lemikhiwa, lezithelo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", lezihlahla ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", lenyosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilizwe lapho elizakudla khona isinkwa esingayikuphela; lalapho lingayikuswela lutho; ilizwe elilamatshe alensimbi, lelilezintaba elingemba kuzo ithusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lizakudla lisuthe, libonge iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu ngelizwe elihle elinike lona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaphelani ukuba lingakhohlwa iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu ngokungagcini imithetho yayo lezimiso zayo lezahlulelo zayo, engililaya zona lamuhla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.13.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 13:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.13.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi lapho selidlile lasutha, lalapho selakhile izindlu ezinhle lahlala kuzo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sekwandile izinkomo zenu lezimvu zenu lesiliva senu legolide lenu lakho konke elilakho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "qaphelani ukuba inhliziyo zenu zingazikhukhumezi, beselikhohlwa iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu eyalikhupha elizweni laseGibithe, endaweni yobugqili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yalihola enkangala enkulu leyesabekayo, eyayigcwele izinyoka ezilobuhlungu lezinkume, elomhlabathi owomileyo, lapho kwakungelamanzi khona. Yalivezela amanzi edwaleni eliqinileyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yalinika ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " enkangala okhokho benu ababengayazi, ukuba ilithobise, ilihlole, ilenzele okuhle ekucineni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaphelani, ukuba lingathi enhliziyweni yenu: Ngawami amandla langamandla esandla sami ngizizuzele limfuyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khumbulani iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu, ngoba yiyo elinika amandla okuzuza imfuyo, ukuba iqinise isivumelwano sayo eyasifunga kubokhokho benu njengokwenza kwayo lamhla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba likhohlwa iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu, lilandele abanye onkulunkulu, likhuleke kibo, libakhonze, ngiyalixwayisa lamhla ukuthi lizakubhubha impela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lizachitheka njengezizwe iNkosi ezakuzichitha phambi kwenu, ngoba lingalilalelanga ilizwi leNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
